    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the counselors just talk about 'processing' and 'moving forward' but i don't want to move forward if he's not there. it feels like i'm just being forced to exist in a world that stopped making sense months ago. sometimes i go to bed and just wish i wouldn't wake up, because waking up is just more of this emptiness. it feels like the only way to actually find any peace is to just stop.",
